    "content": [
     {
      "text": "three days -- Cf. Matthew 12:38-40. By death and resurrection will God have his people separated from Egypt -- the world.; Romans 6:1-11; Galatians 6:14-15; Hebrews 13:12,13."
     }
    ]
   }
